      "writtenOn": "2021-01-13T22:10:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This version continues to avoid re-entering TC_DISABLED if we are already there. It also adds setting a pd_disabled_mask bit when performing an ATTACHED.DISABLE in order to shut the PE off, it is done in a way the existing state mechanism will not be affected. I also added one more Vilboz specific item, since I don\u0027t want to propagate if it is not needed, to not set a charge port if that port is in the disabled state.",
